1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
A captured world can reproduce what we observed.
But did the observations constrain how it works?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:20,000
In this selected APIC-to-PIC repair, ordinary held-out error improves by 14.93%.
An untouched physical-target error worsens by 9.03%. This is a deceptive repair.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The fresh synthetic experiment contains 36 proposals: 12 deceptive and 24 beneficial.
The ordinary criterion proposes the repairs; an untouched target supplies the labels.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Now apply a known force: 40 newtons per top particle, with the bottom layer fixed.
The actual solver responses are shown with displacement magnified 400 times.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Overlay truth and repair under the same probe.
Their material grids reveal a response mismatch.

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Probe positive X, negative X, positive Y and positive Z.
Top and interior displacement components assemble into a response fingerprint.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Subtract the repair and truth displacements to expose the residual field.
Every direction uses the same color scale; numerical values remain unscaled.

8
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:25,000
DCS selects mechanism-sensitive contrasts that cancel lower-order trends.
This second-difference schematic illustrates the idea, not a measured response.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Credible progress is error improvement divided by combined uncertainty:
measurement, repeat variation and numerical refinement.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
The force channel increases median absolute standardized progress from 0.0488 to 0.5586.
That is 11.46 times stronger median signal on the same 36 proposals.

11
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Reveal the frozen threshold: absolute z must reach 2 for a support or veto decision.
Even the maximum force magnitude, 1.3191, remains below it.

12
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:49,000
All 36 remain unresolved. Zero support. Zero veto.
Refuse certification: stronger evidence is not necessarily sufficient evidence.

13
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Looks right does not mean physically verified.
Reality Probe asks the repaired world physical questions.
